DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       mmeemmuussaaggeessttaatt  creates  a PNG file containing a graphical representation
       of the memory profiling data in the file _d_a_t_a_f_i_l_e; that file is  gener‐
       ated via the _-_d (or _-_-_d_a_t_a) option of mmeemmuussaaggee(1).

       The  red  line in the graph shows the heap usage (allocated memory) and
       the green line shows the stack usage.  The x‐scale is either the number
       of memory‐handling function calls or (if the _-_t  option  is  specified)
       time.

